input.newString:
/* ==========================================================================
   District cartogram (E5 extension).

   The header at the top of this file said nothing animates, which was
   true until this block. The one motion below is the cascade moment:
   a twist lands and every tile shade steps over 600ms ease-out, and it
   lives only inside prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference, so a judge
   who asked for reduced motion gets an instant swap (the global reduce
   block in src/index.css zeroes durations again as a second gate).
   Band hue still never arrives as a literal: the five mapping rules
   repeat at the end of this block so each new component resolves its
   band color even when mounted outside the atlas shell.
   ========================================================================== */

/* Headline row: the population panel, one column now that the gauge
   beside it is gone ---------------------------------------------- */

.ax-lead {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
  gap: var(--rp-s4);
  align-items: start;
  min-width: 0;
}

